<h1><span lang="EN-US">Apply</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span class="Path">Transformations &gt; Apply</span></i></b><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Description</span>: The command</b> <span class="Command">Apply</span> <span lang="EN-US">launches the</span> <span class="Mode">Apply</span> <span lang="EN-US">mode. It is always active and can work with or without preliminary selected entities. A transformation can be applied on different entities as many times as needed without exiting the mode.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../transformation_menu/Transformations_files/image002.gif" width="231px" height="524px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Select transformation to apply</span></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">In the list are displayed all available transformations for the current document. A single transformation can be selected and applied to multiple entities.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Apply to</b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:normal;">I</b>n the list are displayed all available entities. One or more can be selected: use the <span class="Shortcut">Shift or Ctrl</span> <span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">buttons for multiple selection. If you have preliminary selected some entities, these will be automatically marked in the list.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span class="Button">Apply</span> <span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>button</b></span></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">T</span><span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">o apply the selected transformation on the selected entities. You can press it as many times as necessary.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Apply reverse</b></span> <span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">button</span></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">To apply the inverse transformation on the selected entities. You can press it as many times as necessary.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:normal;"><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Close</b></span> <span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>button</b></span></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">Exits the</span> <span class="Mode">Apply</span> <span class="Shortcut" lang="EN-US">mode.</span></p>
